<title>UK: Irish Permanent unit sets 150 mln stg 3-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Irish Permanent unit sets 150 mln stg 3-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   IRISH PERMANENT TREASURY PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  IRISH PERMANENT PLC  AMT    150 MLN STG   SPREAD     5 BP	MATURITY    29.NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    29.NOV.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  99.89     FULL FEES   0.125 PCT</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.89</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/IR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.075     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
